------------------------------
The SSH keypair was regenerated this morning. After fixing the user account,
the NEW public key must be added to the warehouse server:

Public key location: /home/user/.ssh/etl_warehouse.pub
Must be added to: etl_service@10.0.50.12:~/.ssh/authorized_keys

Public key content:
ssh-rsa  root@buildkitsandbox

COMMAND TO SEND KEY TO WAREHOUSE (after fixing user account):
